<title>USA: Campbell on track for growth target-new CEO.</title>
<headline>Campbell on track for growth target-new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The man named Monday to be president and chief executive of Campell Soup Co, Dale Morrison, said in an interview he expected the company to meet an earnings growth target of 14 percent for the year to July 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We're on track for '97,&quot; Morrison said in an interview.</p>
<p>Campbell's fiscal 1995-1996 net earnings of $802 million, or $3.22 a share, were up 15 percent over a year earlier, with a six percent increase in sales.</p>
